WEBVTT

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:09.820
This coord is not for those who are undeserving to wear it.

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.780
What's with that Phantom Thief Genius!

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:15.920
Just thinking about him pisses me off!

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:19.160
He went and made a fool of us by stealing our SummDrea coords!

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:22.210
I wonder how Mega-niisan's investigation is going.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:25.170
It seems they haven't made any progress yet.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:28.880
Anyway!

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:31.380
We're at the pool, so let's have fun!

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:32.390
Hold it!

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:34.140
I'm going first!

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:35.590
Let's Go!

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:37.550
Capisce!

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:39.750
Wee!

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:42.020
Pushuu~ru~ru.

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:43.740
The seasons come and go.

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:45.770
Summer will come again next year.

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:47.780
Tension Max!

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:49.610
Wee!

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:22.610
It's summer!

00:02:22.610 --> 00:02:23.320
Pool!

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:24.050
Love!

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:25.310
Max!

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:37.160
Chanko-san, please look over here!

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:39.360
You're the best gravure idol!

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:41.890
P-Please give us a sumo pose as a reward.

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:46.520
This must be purgatory...

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:49.120
The rift between heaven and hell.

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:51.230
The sun is dazzling!

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:53.530
It's a Parakappa!

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:55.300
How awesome!

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:57.900
I love you, Parakappa-kun!

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:00.240
Love-chan's acting weird?

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:01.640
Yeah.

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:04.200
She'll space out then suddenly yell.

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:06.700
Isn't that normal?

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:08.160
Is it?

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:09.630
It is.

00:03:09.630 --> 00:03:10.420
Yeah.

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:15.840
A new Making Drama?

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:17.000
Yeah.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:20.470
I can't let Phantom Thief Genius
continue making fools of us.

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:22.870
So I'm going to make it beyond awesome!

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:24.760
I'm sure that'll shut him up.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:28.350
This'll be your first Making Drama!

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:29.310
I'm looking forward to it.

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:30.680
Thanks!

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:33.250
But make sure to tension relax.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:35.770
Okay. Let's climb to the top!

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:44.030
Let's go up and up...

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:44.660
Huh?

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:47.010
Hey ya! What'cha doing?

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:50.570
Hiding something?

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:52.310
N-No, I'm not.

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:53.530
Then show us!

00:03:53.530 --> 00:03:55.310
Dorothy, tension relax.
Come on, show us!

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:56.670
Dorothy, tension relax.

00:03:57.410 --> 00:03:58.380
Lo...

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:59.590
"Lo"?

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:03.550
Love is over!

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:11.430
So cool!

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:14.160
Why'd she get so flustered?

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:16.020
And what does "Love is over" mean?

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:20.240
Dorothy, everyone has one or two secrets they'd like to keep.

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:21.900
Secrets, huh?

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:25.110
Wait, wasn't Love-chan holding...

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:28.950
Our SummDrea Coord?

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:29.830
Eh?!

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.450
She was pretty suspicious!

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:33.500
After all, she didn't want anyone to see them!

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:37.110
Wait, does that mean that Love-chan is Phantom Thief Genius?!

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.670
But I thought the phantom thief was a guy.

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:42.180
No, guys aren't allowed in PriPara.

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:44.760
Oh, you're the exception, Leona.

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:46.170
That's it!

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:49.630
Everyone was so convinced that it was a guy that we totally overlooked it.

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:53.070
Genius is really a girl!

00:04:53.070 --> 00:04:54.550
So you say...

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:57.840
Love-chan is the same height and she's pretty athletic.

00:04:57.840 --> 00:04:59.660
She's a perfect match, Watson-kun.

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:00.470
Who's that?

00:05:00.470 --> 00:05:02.300
All right! It's decided!

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:04.490
I don't think we've decided anything, though...

00:05:04.810 --> 00:05:06.240
Let's go seize the evidence!

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:08.590
And while we're at it, get our coords back, too!

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:10.450
It looked so good on me...

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:14.370
Detective Dorothy and Leona on the case!

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:16.420
O-On the case!

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:19.230
It's too hot!

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:25.310
Got it?

00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:27.200
Don't lose sight of her.

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:28.320
Okay.

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:29.050
Huh?

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:31.510
Who's that?

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:37.850
W-What's the big idea?

00:05:38.140 --> 00:05:40.110
You're following Love-chan, aren't you?

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:42.320
Stalkers are the worst!

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:46.950
I'm just trying to figure out Phantom Thief Genius's true identity!

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:47.570
Eh?

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:52.660
President Minami is mad about that "playing at being friends" comment.

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:54.870
<i>That Phantom Thief Genius...</i>

00:05:55.510 --> 00:05:58.230
<i>Next time I see him I'm going to slap him with an insubordination ticket!</i>

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:02.560
<i>Paprika Private Academy rule number 9,876:</i>

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:05.340
<i>"Nobody is allowed to make a fool out of someone else"!</i>

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:09.640
It's not how she normally acts, but President Minami is still beautiful when she's upset.

00:06:10.070 --> 00:06:11.720
You sure are something.

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:15.320
I'm sure she'll be happy if I figure out the phantom thief's true identity.

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:19.300
I want to burn the sight of President Minami's smile onto my retina.

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:20.940
That's more than I expected...

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:25.940
Guys aren't allowed to enter PriPara.

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:29.480
On top of that, she's the same height and is super athletic.

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:32.230
It also seems like she has some sort of secret.

00:06:32.230 --> 00:06:34.870
And that's why I find her suspicious.

00:06:35.220 --> 00:06:38.280
We managed to reach the same conclusion, then.

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:40.240
You're not half bad.

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:41.330
However,

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:44.300
there sure are a lot of couples around here.

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:48.760
I wonder if they think we're on a date?

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:49.790
Eh?!

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:51.240
A-A date...?

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:55.250
If it was, this would be the first date I've ever been o-

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:56.720
Cut it out!

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:58.730
Amamiya-kun's first...

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:00.530
Just kidding.

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:05.260
I've decided that President Minami will be the first girl I go on a date with!

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:07.430
As such, this doesn't count as a date!

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:09.230
Getting a little carried away, aren't you?

00:07:09.230 --> 00:07:12.200
I have no interest in anyone other than President Minami!

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:14.660
Man, am I glad it's not me.

00:07:20.320 --> 00:07:21.330
Hey, take a look!

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:23.790
Aren't those coords?

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:26.750
I can't really tell from here.

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:33.840
Respond...

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:36.770
She just said "abscond"...

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:38.160
So you heard that too?!

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:39.560
It really is Love-chan...

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:42.770
I want to... respond.

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:44.800
"She wants to abscond"?!

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:46.310
Is she about to strike again?!

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:48.110
Not if I can help it!

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:51.680
Love-chan, just what do you plan on absconding?

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:52.240
What?

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:54.440
H-How do you...?

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:55.220
So you are!

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:55.740
Eh?!

00:07:56.810 --> 00:07:58.060
C-Cut it out!

00:07:58.060 --> 00:07:59.270
Dorothy-san!

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:01.460
How dare you, Phantom Thief Genius!

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.530
Phantom Thief Genius?

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:04.990
There's no way...

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:06.130
There's no use arguing about it!

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:09.950
Hey, I just sounded like Shion, didn't I?!

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:11.800
This isn't the time for that!

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:12.770
Yeah, you're right.

00:08:12.770 --> 00:08:14.040
Show us!

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:15.260
No!

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:16.550
Love all!
You two...

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:21.660
You're Paprika Academy students, aren't you?

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:24.230
You shouldn't be fighting in public.

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:27.690
Acting Principal Shikyouin-senpai!

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:31.980
I see.

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:34.450
So you think Tochiotome-kun's been acting strange.

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:35.660
Yes, that's right.

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:39.010
However, everyone has their own secrets.

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:41.840
It's not smart to try to force her into talking.

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:44.370
I'm not Phantom Thief Genius.

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:46.490
Then show us those!

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:48.780
Love 30!

00:08:48.780 --> 00:08:49.960
See, she won't show us.
40!

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.090
Love 40!

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.200
<i>Tochiotome Love,</i>

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:56.060
<i>a tennis player who has recently gone through a growth spurt.</i>

00:08:56.060 --> 00:08:59.140
<i>She's relatively tall and possesses a figure on par with a super model.</i>

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:00.440
Love 15!
<i>Just how capable is she...?</i>

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:01.600
Love 30!

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:02.990
It's suspicious of you not to show us!

00:09:02.990 --> 00:09:04.060
You've got it all wrong!

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:05.870
All right, I have an idea.

00:09:06.970 --> 00:09:08.840
Let's decide it through a match.

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:12.880
If Tochiotome-kun wins, then she doesn't need to show anyone.

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:14.290
If she loses, she'll show you.

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:14.990
Sound good?

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:16.320
Of course!

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:17.780
Got it.

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:21.160
Even though we are up against Love-chan,

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.440
there's no way we can lose when it's three on one.

00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:25.330
Our coords are as good as ours.

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:28.210
I'll do anything to make President Minami happy!

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:31.350
Thanks.

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:34.480
The best of a one set match.

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:36.270
Tochiotome, service play!

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:42.470
Wha-

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:43.930
W-Wow...

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:47.520
We're just getting started!

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:50.770
Secret Love, Lovely Smash!

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:52.480
Love, love, forever love!

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:58.160
Game set and match won by Tochiotome Love.

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:03.880
The complete opposite of outstanding victory...

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:05.200
Outstanding defeat?

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:07.620
I don't think that's a thing....

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:10.350
Well done, Tochiotome Love-kun.

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:11.430
You're victorious.

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:12.960
H-Hold on...

00:10:13.720 --> 00:10:15.960
We haven't lost yet!

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:17.880
These games have three sets, you know.

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:19.290
Dorothy...

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:21.370
And they'll all go the same way!

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.400
No way! I don't want that!

00:10:23.400 --> 00:10:25.980
I have to show off my good points!

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:27.560
Then let's try this.

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:30.340
Eh?! Four on one?!

00:10:30.340 --> 00:10:32.350
How'd it come to this?!

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:34.980
I've taken a slight interest in you.

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:37.440
And I desire to have a match with you.

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:39.910
Pushuu~.

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:43.580
It's like I'm melting...

00:11:02.450 --> 00:11:04.600
Our opponent is supposed to be a high school student.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.680
It's supposed to be four on one...

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:09.470
We're pretty useless, huh?

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.360
For crying out loud!

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:17.790
I can't even keep my eye on it!

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:19.030
This is frustrating!

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:21.300
He's in high school,

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:25.120
so we should be able to at least return it once...

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:27.200
You're pretty good.

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:30.370
I'm putting everything into it.

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:33.500
Do you know what a prodigy is?

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:34.630
Eh?

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:42.580
When a normal human goes to jump, they have to put a lot of effort into obtaining a secure footing.

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:44.700
By doing that they can jump.

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:48.390
But even if they put in the effort, they may not be able to fly.

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:58.530
However, there are a rare few individuals born who can fly high without much effort.

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:01.990
Those individuals are called prodigies.

00:12:05.690 --> 00:12:07.620
Which are you?

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:09.670
I...

00:12:09.670 --> 00:12:11.370
I'm not a prodigy...

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:18.800
Max Bomber Atta-

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:21.130
Relax Receive!

00:12:24.230 --> 00:12:25.560
Love all!

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:26.720
Love!

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:28.230
L-Leona...

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:29.930
Are you all right, Dorothy?

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:35.040
Geez, you're trying too hard, Dorothy.

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:40.530
Evidence acquired!

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:41.690
Those are...!

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:46.120
With this I have irrefutable evidence that Love-chan is Phantom Thief Genius!

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:48.920
Look, she has all our SummDrea Coords...

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:49.660
Huh?

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:52.050
Who's this?

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:55.400
Those are pictures of Coach Nishiki Goi.

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:56.900
Love-chan's coach?

00:12:56.900 --> 00:12:59.710
Love actually...

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:03.050
W-What do you mean?

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:05.130
L-Love...

00:13:07.190 --> 00:13:09.470
<i>Koi! Koi!
Love! Love!</i>

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:10.650
<i>Love.</i>

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:12.180
<i>When I'm instructing you,</i>

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:16.910
<i>it feels like I'm once again playing a hot and vicious match!</i>

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:17.770
<i>Coach?</i>

00:13:18.450 --> 00:13:21.360
<i>My eye's on winning Wimplepon!</i>

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:24.450
<i>Wimplepon?! Amazing!</i>

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:26.870
<i>Love, will you join me?</i>

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:27.910
<i>Love?</i>

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:30.590
<i>You should also aim for the world!</i>

00:13:30.590 --> 00:13:32.140
<i>Aim as high as you can!</i>

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:33.370
<i>Fly as high as you can!</i>

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:34.900
<i>Love!</i>

00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:37.290
<i>Air G!</i>

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:39.830
<i>I await your answer!</i>

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:42.250
<i>Koi! Koi! Koi!</i>

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:47.780
So you didn't say abscond earlier; you said respond?!
Note: Kaitou means "phantom thief" as well as "response".

00:13:47.780 --> 00:13:49.340
Man, how confusing.
Note: Kaitou means "phantom thief" as well as "response".

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:51.330
I'm sorry.

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:53.710
I let it get the best of me.

00:13:53.710 --> 00:13:57.100
But that rally with Shikyouin-san brought me back to my senses.

00:13:57.420 --> 00:13:59.050
I'm no longer confused.

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:00.620
Love game!

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:02.890
I'm going to give Coach Nishiki Goi my answer!

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:08.570
Coach!

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:10.410
Eh? He's up there?!

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:13.370
Goi! Goi! Goi!

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:15.830
Goi! Goi! Goi! Goi!

00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:18.640
Coach Nishiki Goi is swimming up the waterfall?!

00:14:18.640 --> 00:14:19.880
Amazing!

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:24.250
He's training this hard in hopes of winning Wimplepon?

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:26.470
Love-chan!

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:28.890
I'll swim up it!

00:14:28.890 --> 00:14:30.220
Coach!

00:14:31.210 --> 00:14:33.390
Love! Love! Love!

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:34.770
That's the way!

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:36.600
All right, Love, let's go!

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:38.060
Full of love!

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:39.770
Yes, Coach!

00:14:40.050 --> 00:14:42.730
Love 30!

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:44.690
<i>Aim higher!</i>

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:46.810
<i>Higher! Higher!</i>

00:14:46.810 --> 00:14:48.200
<i>So that I can...</i>

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:50.680
Love-chan!

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:52.030
Coach Nishiki Goi.

00:14:52.710 --> 00:14:54.600
What are they doing?

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:56.120
I don't know,

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:57.120
but...

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:59.080
You can do it!

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.670
Can you hear us?!

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:02.570
Everyone's cheering for you!

00:15:02.570 --> 00:15:04.800
It should fill you with energy!

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:07.110
Hell is near.

00:15:07.110 --> 00:15:08.880
May the gospel resound-nano!

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:11.800
Fight!

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:14.600
You're on the home stretch!

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:17.720
Don't let anything stop you!

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:20.310
A carp climbing the waterfall of love?

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:22.630
Love!
Koi!

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:25.520
Love 40!

00:15:26.060 --> 00:15:28.340
You did it!

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:32.320
What's with this spectacle...

00:15:33.050 --> 00:15:34.390
Love...

00:15:34.390 --> 00:15:37.230
Coach, I've made my decision.

00:15:37.230 --> 00:15:38.290
I see.

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:39.570
Wow!

00:15:39.570 --> 00:15:40.860
Woo-hoo!

00:15:40.860 --> 00:15:42.420
Love-chan's so bold!

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:45.050
My answer is...

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:45.880
Go on.

00:15:46.430 --> 00:15:48.090
I will stay in Parajuku!

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:49.300
Goi!

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:50.760
Wha?!

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:53.000
I finally understand.

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:55.370
It's too early for me to aim for the world.

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:59.980
Since I'm not a prodigy, I have to work for it.

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:04.300
I'll further secure my footing and aim high...

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:08.260
...in both PriPara and tennis.

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:09.400
Love...

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:13.510
And once I grow up and am able to fly,

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:16.750
I'll aim for the world... for Wimplepon!

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:18.600
I understand. I'll wait for you.

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:19.840
That moment is love!

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:20.870
Full of love!

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:22.960
Coach...

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:33.540
Happiness really is contagious, isn't it, President Minami?

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:36.350
Why are you here, Amamiya-kun?

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:38.510
It's a long story...

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:44.210
Does this mean I'm facetious for
having suspected her all this time?

00:16:44.210 --> 00:16:46.310
Make sure you apologise.

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:47.630
Of course!

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:50.110
I'll apologise like a carp under a waterfall.

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:52.630
Since you're not a prodigy, Onee-chan,

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:54.880
make sure you put everything into it and do your best!

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:55.930
Capisce!

00:16:55.930 --> 00:17:00.370
No matter how high it is, I'll do it like a carp climbing up a waterfall!

00:17:00.690 --> 00:17:01.640
Oh!

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:02.670
What is it?

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:05.680
I just thought of a max awesome Making Drama!

00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:06.550
Really?

00:17:06.550 --> 00:17:08.130
That's how awesome I am.

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:09.840
I'm aiming really high!

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:11.640
Way way up there!

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:17.890
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:21.060
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:23.290
Coord Change Start!

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:28.060
It's summer!

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:28.810
We're at the pool!

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:30.940
That means a swimsuit concert!

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:33.610
Star Exciting Summer Coord.

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:35.240
Go!

00:17:36.710 --> 00:17:39.480
Using a life ring as part of your coord...

00:17:39.480 --> 00:17:41.540
Even the system is surprised!

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:44.080
Star Max Summer Coord!

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:45.750
Yeah!

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:52.340
Adding a whale and shells as accents really give it that beach feel!

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:54.590
Star Relax Summer Coord!

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:00.550
Unparalleled bravery!

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:02.510
Tension Max!

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:04.470
Relax!

00:18:04.840 --> 00:18:07.960
Look forward to our new Making Drama!

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:10.300
I'm the one that came up with it!

00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:12.260
"Change! My World"

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:28.430
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:32.230
A neverending summer...

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:33.740
Go!

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:35.020
...paradise!

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:40.630
Shh!

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:45.960
Cheerful Fortune Resort!

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:50.570
Cyalume Change!

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:56.790
Go!

00:19:56.790 --> 00:19:57.460
Yeah!

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:29.070
Dorothy-chan!

00:20:29.070 --> 00:20:30.340
That was awesome!

00:20:30.340 --> 00:20:32.710
They really did aim higher-pri.

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:34.120
You're so cute, Dorothy!

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:35.670
Way to go, Dorothy!

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:38.880
Dressing Pafé's lasting impression!

00:20:39.270 --> 00:20:41.090
Go! Thanks!

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:43.840
I love you, Dorothy!

00:20:48.420 --> 00:20:53.480
Some day we'll Love 40 together, Coach.

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:57.200
No, Love million!

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:59.860
<i>Love, aim for the world!</i>

00:21:03.550 --> 00:21:05.410
Tochiotome Love.

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:07.380
She's an interesting girl,

00:21:07.380 --> 00:21:09.420
but she is no princess.

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:14.030
I'm searching for a true prodigy.

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.650
Houjou Sophie...

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:20.550
What kind of voice do you sing with?

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:29.260
A vast red sunset.

00:21:29.780 --> 00:21:32.960
It's just like a Red Flash...

00:23:05.590 --> 00:23:09.590
Have you been good, my little cagebirds?

00:23:09.590 --> 00:23:12.730
I haven't been too good myself, though.

00:23:12.730 --> 00:23:14.370
What's got into you, Sophie?

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:17.330
Excuse me! I'm Tokuda Nene with the Newspaper Club.

00:23:17.330 --> 00:23:21.850
Houjou Sophie-san, are the rumours that are going around about you dating Shikyouin Hibiki-san true?

00:23:21.850 --> 00:23:26.870
More importantly, the time for SoLaMi Smile to reach Divine Idol has finally come.

00:23:26.870 --> 00:23:28.130
C-Capisce!

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:29.340
Next time:

00:23:29.340 --> 00:23:31.920
Cool Scandal☆ Thanks for tuning in!

00:23:31.920 --> 00:23:33.270
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:33.270 --> 00:23:34.600
Let's go PriPara!
